@startuml seq_deployment
title In-game deployment procedure (as printed in the report)

participant "Carrier" as C
participant "SAT-1" as S1
participant "SAT-2" as S2
participant "SAT-3" as S3

== Setup ==
C -> C : 1. circularize at h_target
C -> C : 2. retrograde burn at apoapsis\nperiapsis → h_peri (parking orbit)

== t = 0 (carrier at apoapsis) ==
C -> S1 : 3. release
S1 -> S1 : circularize at r_c

== t = T_e ==
note over C, S1 : SAT-1 advanced 240°; carrier is 120° behind it
C -> S2 : 5. release
S2 -> S2 : circularize at r_c

== t = 2·T_e ==
note over C, S2 : SAT-1 at 120°, SAT-2 at 240° relative to the carrier
C -> S3 : 7. release
S3 -> S3 : circularize at r_c

== Done ==
note over S1, S3 : 8. three satellites spaced 120° apart
@enduml
